OL,6,FThieves have stolen four works of art
OL,7,Ffrom a Renoir museum in France -
OL,8,Fdropping one as they fled, a local
OL,9,Fmayor says
OL,11,FThe mayor's office says the estimated
OL,12,Fvalue of the stolen art work is 9m
OL,13,Feuros ($7.7m; $10.5m), the AFP news
OL,14,Fagency reports
